<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 AKOLINTO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Pauli kwa Akolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Akolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Kol</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Akolinto</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Pauli kwa Akolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa 2 Akolinto, saandikilwe na Ntumilwe Pauli myaka ya 55 mpaka 56 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Kilisitu (1:1). Ayi', yaai balua yenebi'li' mu balua ibi'li' yatubile nayo yaiandikilwe na Pauli kwa kanisa lya Akolinto. Asomi bau'bi'lya panga, apo nsu'gu', Pauli aandike balua yo kalipa kwa Akolinto, lakini tunagapatali maigala ga balua yo yailongelya mu 2:3-4. Yu'bi'li'ka panga, kitabu sa 2 Akolinto saandikilwe na Pauli paabile Makedonia (2:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa 2 Akolinto kibayilwa saakisake kwa mwanjaa, balua yi' ili'nga mawaso gagabile nkati muno ya mwandiki. Pauli alaya pulaika kwake bu'kana na Abali Inannoga yaipokile bu'ka kwa Tito yaibu'kana na kanisa lya Kolinto. Mu balua yi', tupata mayi'gano ga kinkati gagabu'kana no piya bu'ka mu ilimu ya Lilagano Lyayambi', mukipungu sa Pauli palagya sangisa mbanje li'nga kwayangatia aumini ba Yelusalemu (8-9). Ibonekana panga, bi'ngi' ba Atumilwe ba ubu'su' bu'ka panja ya kanisa, batumyage undumu wa bandu bi'ngi' mukanisa babasindana na Pauli kwa kwikwi'ya bene. Baau'bi'li lili bu'kana na utawala wa Pauli, aso, kwaali' ngasampangite apiye ukong'ondeli wake kwa makakala bu'kana na utawala wa Utumilwe wake panga, ywembe Ntumilwe wa Yesu Kilisitu kuundi'la ya kitabu sa 2 Akolinto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pauli aitumbwa balua yake kwo salimia kanisa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:1-7">1:1-7</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Pauli alongelya galambuka kwa mwanja wake na abali yaipokile bu'ka kwa bembe na mwabayangwile bu'kana na balua yake yailongolile <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:8-7:16">1:8-7:16</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pauli apiya malagyo bu'kana na misango ya mbanje kwa aumini ba Yelusalemu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1-9:15</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pauli aikengya bu'kana na utume wake na kwakwi'li'ka bu'kana mwanja wake wawisa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10:1-13:10</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Balua yi'no iandikilwe na nenga na Pauli nantumilwe wa Kilisitu Yesu bu'kana na mwapendi Nnu'ngu', pamope na nnunangu' Timoteo. Tumwandikyanga mwenga mwa likanisa lya Nnu'ngu' lya Kolinto na apeleteu boti ba kunkoa wa Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Tunnu'byanga ngu'ngu' na amani yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu na Yesu Kilisitu Bwana witu, ibe na mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunsukulu Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Akwi'yi'lwe Nnu'ngu' Tati' ba Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu, Tati' bene kiya na Nnu'ngu' ywatukamwamboko mumakowe gitu goti. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Ywembe atukamwamboko twenga mutabu yitu yoti, li'nga na twenga tuwese kwakamwamboko bi'ngi' mukila tabu kwa mboko yoyoyo yatupokya bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kati mu'lu' mwatuyendelya ku'su'mbu'lwa muno kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu, nyinyonyo Nnu'ngu' ngayendelya kutukamwamboko muno kwo pi'tya kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Manaitei twenga katuku'su'mbu'lwa, ipangika li'nga mupate kamulwamboko no kosopolelwa. Manaitei katukamulwamboko, nyinyonyo na mwenga mukamulwamboko no pata makakala ga kumpanga mukomeye tabu yi'yi'lu'yi'lu' yatuipata. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Liu'bi'lyo litu kwinu mwenga likangamile kwa mwanjaa tutangite panga, mu'lu' mwamuku'su'mbu'lwa kati twenga, ngamo mwaakamulwamboko kati twenga.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Kwa mwanjaa tupendili mwaalongo mukotoke tanga abali ya siki yaitupatike ku Asia panga, twaatopilwe pi'ta makakala gitu no ika po ti'kwanika mwoyo wo yendelya lama. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Twabene twibonage tuukumilwe kiwo. Kumbe gaatupiti go, li'nga twaakane kwiu'bi'lya twabene, ila tumwu'bi'li Nnu'ngu' ywayu'ya babawile. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ywembe nga ywaatukosopoli twenga mumaule maku'lu' ga kiwo, na aalu'a kutukosopolya kai'. Kwake ywembe tubi'i mau'bi'lyo gitu panga, aayendelya kutukosopolya, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />kati mu'lu' mwamulu'mbine yangatiyana na twenga kwo lu'ba, baingi baalu'a sukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu situ kwa ndi'la ya balaka ya ngu'ngu' yitu kwo yangwa lu'ba kwa baingi.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galambuka kwa mwanja wa Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Bai, twenga twipunia kikowe simo. Myoyo yitu itukong'ondelya panga, tutami mudunia yi'no kwo nogeya no u'bi'li'ka kwa bu'kana na Nnu'ngu'. Tupangiteli nyo kwa ikima yaibu'ka mudunia yi'no, ila kwa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu'. Amo nga mwatutami mudunia yi'no, munomuno muumope witu na mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Bai, mubalua yitu tumwandikyangali kwo iyaiya, ila makowe gamuwesa kugasoma na kugatanga. Nipi'kanilya panga, mulu'a tanga wiso, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kwa mwanjaa, mpaka nambi'yambi' mutangite pasene bai, tutangite panga, mulisu'ba li'lu' lya Bwana Yesu, mwaalu'a kwipunia kwitu twenga kati twenga mwatwiipunia kwinu mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Bu'kana no u'bi'lya ku', naabini longolya isa kasinu wi'ti', li'nga mupate balaka yo tyangililwa na nenga mala ibi'li'. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Naabini nipi'ti kasinu kaniyenda Makedonia, na nibuyangani kasinu kai', li'nga muniyabuye mumwanja wangu' wo yenda Yudea. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Buli, muwasa panga nimunaise mwanja wangu' wo ki'li'bu'kya kasinu kwa mwanjaa nenga nikombwali yi'mya ganigaamwa? Au muwasa panga nilongoyelwa na maganio ga kimundu bai, ngainipanga nibaye “Eloo” nambi'yambi' na nnu'ngi' nibaye “Lili”? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Lakini kati Nnu'ngu' mwabile ywo u'bi'li'ka, liyi'gi'yo litu kasinu ipalikwali kwa pamope baya “Eloo” na “Lili.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Kwa mwanjaa, Kilisitu Yesu Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' yu'lu' ywatwaamwalike nenga, Sila na Timoteo, aabileli ywa “Eloo” na “Lili” kwa pamope, ila kwake ywembe masu'ba goti aai ywa “Eloo.” <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Kwa mwanjaa ywembe ngatimisike malagano goti ga Nnu'ngu' gabe “Eloo.” Kwa kitumbu so, “Amina” yitu ibayilwa kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu li'nga kumpeya utukupu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Bai, ywembe ywatupanga tukangamale pamope na mwenga mu Kilisitu na kutusawa, nga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Ngaywatubi'i muuli wa kutupanga twa mali yake ywembe na kutuyalya Loo mumyoyo yitu kwo tomelelya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tomelelya nga mali'po go tumbulya popi'ma kili'be. </char></note> makowe goti gatubi'kile.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nnu'ngu' atangite panga niku'pi'yali, nibuyanganili Kolinto kwa kitumbu sa kummi'kya mwenga lwu'ngu', mwakane lumya. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Tukani tumya makakala bu'kana na imani yinu, mwanjaa, mwenga mukangamile muimani yinu. Ila twenga twapanga kasi pamope na mwenga kwa kitumbu sa pulaa yinu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Kwa nyo, pamwoyo wangu' naabini kanenise kasinu kai', li'nga naakane kunnumiya mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Kwa mwanjaa, mana nimpangite mwenga muusunike, ntu'pu' ywaalu'a nipanga nipulaike kai', ila mwenga mwanimpangite muusunike! <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Naandike nyo li'nga mana niisile mwakane kuniusunisa, mwabandu mwamupalikwa kunipanga nenga nipulaike. Niu'bi'lya panga, nenga mana nipulaike, nyinyonyo na mwenga mwaboti mwapulaika. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Namwandiki balua yi'lu' kwa lwu'ngu' na maku'ku'li'ko makali' pamwoyo wangu', kai' na kwa moli gambone. Kwo panga nyo, naabinili kumpanga muusunike, ila nipalage mutange mu'lu' mwanimpendi muno.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Manaitei mundu amuusunise nnyine, aniusuniseli nenga bai, pi'ngi' tuwesa baya, amuusunise mwenga mwaboti na nipendili kugaku'ya muno makowe. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Kwake ywembe, mbwatyo yayomwike pwatilwa na bandu baingi pakati yinu, inni'ngani. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Sakiigalile kwinu mwenga, ili'ngani kunsamya na kunkamwamboko mundu ywo, li'nga aakane usunika muno no ti'kwanika mwoyo mpamo. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Kwa nyo ninkong'ondelya, munnaye mpu'la panga mwendakumpenda. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Kitumbu si'ngi' sa kumwandikyanga balua yi'lu' yaai, li'nga nintange panga, mutami wiso kuniyu'wa kwa kila kikowe. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Mana munsami mundu, nanenga nendakunsamya. Kwa mwanjaa paninsamya, mana kakape nibile na kikowe na ywembe, nisamya nnu'ngi' ya Kilisitu kwa kitumbu sinu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />li'nga kanetumpei Ibilisi lipala lyakutukonga, kwa mwanjaa tugatangite mwagabile mabinio gake.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyukala sa Pauli kukilambo sa Troa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Panaaikite ku Troa kwiala Abali Inannoga ya Kilisitu, naakoli Bwana aniyu'gu'lile niango wo panga lyengo lyake kwo. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Lakini naapulaikeli pamwoyo wangu', kwa mwanjaa nankoli lili Tito muumini nnyangu'. Kwa nyo, nganaalaga bandu ba kilambo so no yenda Makedonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usindi kwo yangatiyilwa na Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Lakini tunsukulu Nnu'ngu' ywatulongoya mumwanja wa usindi wa Kilisitu masu'ba goti. Ywembe atupanga tuubambiye ukweli wa Kilisitu kati lumba lunannungya lwalutwi'lya kila pandu. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kwa mwanjaa twenga twalumba lunannungya lwa ubani, alwo Kilisitu apiya kwa Nnu'ngu'. Lumba lwo lwaikya boti babakosopolelwa na babaoba. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kwa balu' babaoba, lumba lwo nga kiwo, lakini kwa balu' babakosopolelwa, lumba lwo nga ukoto. Bai lelo, pangali Nnu'ngu', ntu'pu' ywakombwa panga lyengo lyo. <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Twenga tubileli kati balu' bi'ngi' babapanga nsuluso wa liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. Tuala kwo nogeya no lu'mbana na Kilisitu nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' kati twabandu twatutumilwe na Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Atumilwe ba Lilagano lyayambi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Buli, tutumbwa kai' kwilumba kasinu? Lili, twenga tubileli kati bi'ngi' babannetya balua yo pala mwatange, au bantange. <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Mwenga mwabene nga mwabalua yitu yo tanganikwa, yaiandikilwe mumyoyo yitu kila mundu aibone na kwisoma. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Ibonekana mpu'la panga mwenga mwa balua yaiandikilwe na Kilisitu no tumilwa kwo pi'tya utumisi witu. Balua yi' iandikilweli na bwino, ila kwa Loo wa Nnu'ngu' mwene ukoto, na iandikilweli panani ya maliwe, ila mumyoyo ya bandu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Tuwesa baya go kwa ukangamau wa Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Kwenda twenga tuwesa panga sosoti kwa makakala gitu twabene lili, ila uweso witu woti ubu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Kwa mwanjaa ywembe ngatupei makakala go, li'nga tube twatumisi bake ba lilagano lyayambi'. Lilagano lyo lya salya yaiandikilweli, ila libu'ka kwa Loo. Salya yaiandikilwe ileta kiwo, ila Loo aleta ukoto.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Pamope no panga salya yayaandikilwe mumaliwe iletage kiwo, yaaisi kwa utukupu wo ng'alang'atya, mpaka Baisilaili baakombwili lingulya kuminyo ya Musa. Baasindwi kunningulya, kwa mwanjaa kuminyo yake kwaating'alang'atya pamope no panga ng'alang'atya kwake kwasi'yiteli yomoka. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Kwa nyo, lyengo lya lilagano lyayambi' lyaliisa kwa Loo libile na utukupu pi'ta. <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Pano nilombolya panga, ndi'la ya kwai'mbu' ya kuntumikia Nnu'ngu' yaabi'i bandu musambi na kwapeya ukumu, lakini yaabile na utukupu. Kwa nyo, ndi'la yayambi' yaileta aki ibile na utukupu nku'lu' pi'ta. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Tuwesa baya panga, wu'lu' utukupu waung'alang'atyage kwai'mbu', uwesali landana na utukupu wa nambi'yambi' waubile nku'lu' pi'ta. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Manaitei si'lu' sasaakotwike konda saabile na utukupu, asi' sakikonda milele kibile na utukupu pi'ta.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Kwa mwanjaa, ali' nga lyatuliu'bi'lya, twenga twatulongela kwo kangamala. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Twenga tupangali kati Musa ywawi'ki'li kitambala kuminyo li'nga Baisilaili kanebakubone ku'lu' ng'alang'atya kwakuimika. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Lakini malango gabe gaai matopau kwo tanga. Ata mpaka nambi'yambi', Baisilaili pabasoma muitabu ya lilagano lya kwai'mbu', malango gabe gawi'ki'li'lwa na kitambala si'si'lu'si'lu'. Kitambala so saabu'yi'lwa kwa mundu ywalu'mbana na Kilisitu bai. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Eloo, mpaka li'no kila pabasoma salya ya Musa, malango gabe gapanga gawi'ki'lilwe. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Lakini palu' bai mundu panng'alambukya Bwana, kitambala si'lu' sendabu'yi'lwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Pano, Bwana nga Loo, na palu' paabile Loo wa Bwana nga paubile uulu.<verse eid="2CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Bai, twenga twangali wi'ki'lya kuminyo yitu na kitambala, tulaya utukupu wa Bwana kati mu'lu' mwatulola mukilolo. Na twenga twendagalambuyilwa li'nga tulandane nakwe bu'ka muutukupu mpaka kuutukupu nku'lu' muno. Bwana nga Loo, ngaywapanga lyengo lyo.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mabi'ko ga Loo mukibi'ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' atupei lyengo li' kwa kiya sake, tutotokelwali pamwoyo. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Lakini tugakani makowe ga oni gagayu'bite na tupangali kwo ku'pi'ya, wala tuliyangabanali liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' na ubu'su'. Ila, kwa kwikong'ondelya kweli, twiilaya panga tubile na aki kwa myoyo ya bandu boti nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Manaitei Abali inannoga yatuala iteiyanika, iyanike kwa balu' bababi'ngi'ya ndi'la yo oba bai. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Bandu bo bamwu'bi'lyali Yesu kwa mwanjaa Ibilisi, nkulungwa wa dunia yi'no, agawi'ki'li malango gabe. Aso nga kitumbu sabasindwa kuubona bweya wa Abali Inannoga ya utukupu wa Kilisitu, ywalaya mwabile Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Kwa mwanjaa, tualali makowe gitu twabene, ila tumwala Kilisitu Yesu nga Bwana, na twenga twabene nga twatumisi binu kwa kitumbu sa Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Nnu'ngu' ywaabaite, “Bweya ung'alang'ati mulubi'ndu',” nga ywang'alang'atya mumyoyo yitu, li'nga atupei bweya wa ilimu ya utukupu wa Nnu'ngu' kuminyo ya Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Lakini twenga tubile na mabi'ko ga kiloo kati kibi'ga so kanjwanika li'nga bandu balole uweso wu' wa maayabu muno waubu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', kwenda kwitu twabene lili. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Twendaku'su'mbu'lwa ku'no na ku'no, lakini tubanilwali, tutangiteli lyo panga, lakini tuti'kwanikali mwoyo, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />twendateselwa, lakini Nnu'ngu' atulekali, tutu'yi'lwe pai', lakini tulangamiswali. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Masu'ba goti yi'ga yitu ibile mmaule kwo waa kati Yesu, li'nga ukoto wa Yesu ubonekane muyi'ga yitu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Kwa mwanjaa, twenga twatubile twabau'mi masu'ba goti tupiyilwe tuwee kwa kitumbu sa Yesu, li'nga ukoto wake upate bonekana muyi'ga yitu yo waa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Kwa nyo, twenga tubile mmaule go waa, lakini nkati ya alyo, mwenga mupata ukoto.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya panga, <char style="qt">“Naamwu'bi'li Nnu'ngu', nga kitumbu sanaalongei.”</char> Na twenga kai' nyinyonyo tubile na imani yi'yi'lu'yi'lu', twendau'bi'lya, ngapo tulongela. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Tulongela nyo kwa mwanjaa tutangite panga, yu'lu' ywannyu'yite Bwana Yesu bu'ka kuuwi'li aalu'a kutuyu'ya twenga kai', kati mu'lu' mwannyu'yite Yesu, na kutuleta twenga pamope na mwenga nnu'ngi' yake. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Kwa nyo, makowe ga goti kwa pwaila yinu, li'nga ngu'ngu' yayaikya bandu baingi muno iyongeyelwe. Bu'kana na lyo, sukulu kwalu'a yongeyelwa, na Nnu'ngu' aakwi'yi'lwa.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tama kwa imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Kwa nyo, tuti'kwanikali mwoyo ata pasene. Pamope no panga ube witu wa panja wendaalabika, lakini ube witu wa nkati uyu'ka wayambi' kila lisu'ba. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Kwa mwanjaa, siki yitu yatupata njene bai na ikondali, itubi'kya wiso utukupu nku'lu' muno na wangayomoka waubile nnogau pi'ti'li'ki'ya mateso ga. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Kwa mwanjaa, twenga tulingulyali ili'be yaibonekana, ila tulingulya yangalibonekana. Yi'lu' yaibonekana ikondali, lakini yi'lu' yangalibonekana ikonda mpaka milele.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Kwa mwanjaa, tutangite panga ema yatutama nkati yake pano padunia, lombolya yi'ga yitu, yalu'a alabika. Palyapitya lyo, Nnu'ngu' aabi'ka wiso nyumba yo tama twenga nkati yake. Yaalandanali na yaisengelwa na bandu pano padunia, yaapanga ya kunani yayaalu'a konda milele. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Lakini nsimu wu'no patubile na ema yi'no, twendaminya kwo minyikia muno kwa Nnu'ngu' kutupeya nyumba yitu yayambi' ya kunani li'nga tupate tama. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Twaatama munyumba yayambi' ya kunani yayaatupanga kanetubonekane tubile panja. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Pano patubile balo muema ya dunia yi'no, twendaminya no topelwa, kwenda tupala tama panja lili, ila tubile na kilu'lu' so tama munyumba yi'lu' yangali alabika li'nga kiwo kimililwe mpamo na ukoti. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Bai, Nnu'ngu' mwene nga ywatubi'i wiso kwa kitumbu sa makowe go na kutupeya Loo Mpeleteu nkati yitu, panga kitomelelyo sa ili'be yoti yatubi'kile.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Kwa nyo, tubile twakangamala saa yoti. Tutangite panga, patuyendelya tama muyi'ga yi'no, tubaa kuutalu na kitamo situ pamope na Bwana. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Tutama kwa galu' gatuu'bi'lya, kwenda kwa gatugabonali. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Lakini tubile twakangamala na twaapendile ata kugaleka maisa gano ga padunia no amya kwa Bwana. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Lakini likowe lya ngama muno, tupala kumpulaisa Bwana, ibe patutama pano padunia au akwo. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Kwa mwanjaa, twenga twaboti tupalikwa yi'ma nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa ukumu sa Kilisitu, li'nga kila yumo apoki gagapalikwa bu'kana na gaagapangite paabile padunia, gabe manogau au maakau.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awaniyilwa na Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa tutangite kumwisimu Nnu'ngu', kwa nyo, tukasana kwauta bi'ngi'. Lakini Nnu'ngu' atutangite mwatubile, nanenga niu'bi'lya kai' panga namwenga mututangite wisowiso. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Kwenda tupaya kai' kwilumba twabene nnu'ngi' yinu li, ila tummakia mwenga lipala lya kwipuna kwa kitumbu situ, li'nga mupate kwayangwa balu' babaipunia ube wabe wa panja kulikoni mwababile pamwoyo wabe. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Mana tubonekine panga tuobite malango kati mwabatubaya, alyo kwa pwaila ya Nnu'ngu', na manaitei tubile na malango gitu, alyo kwa pwaila yinu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Kwa mwanjaa upendo wa Kilisitu utulongoya twenga twatuyi'ki'tya panga, mundu yumo bai ngaywawile kwa kitumbu sa bandu boti, ilombolya panga boti bapanga kiselele kwa kiwo sake. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Nembe aawile kwa kitumbu sa bandu boti li'nga boti babatama bau'mi kanebatame kwa kitumbu sabe bene, ila batame kwa kitumbu sake ywembe ywawile no yu'yi'lwa kwa kitumbu sabe.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Bai, tumbulya nambi'yambi', twenga tummalangilyali mundu ywoywoti muisabu ya kimundu, pamope no panga twammalangi Kilisitu muisabu yi'yi'lu'yi'lu', lakini nambi'yambi' tupangali kai' nyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Mundu ywoywoti mana alu'mbine na Kilisitu, apanga kyumbe sayambi', makowe ga kwai'mbu' gabu'i, lingulya, gapangite gayambi'! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Lyoti lyengo lya Nnu'ngu' ywatuawaniye twenga na mwene kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu, na kutupeya lyengo lya kwaawana bandu na ywembe mwene. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Ngo baya panga, Nnu'ngu' aabile kaiawana dunia na ywembe mwene kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu, pangali balanga masambi gababile nago bandu. Ywembe aatulagi tuale liyi'gi'yo lya kwaawana bandu na ywembe mwene.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Bai, twenga tuyi'ma paali pa Kilisitu, na Nnu'ngu' mwene atutumya twenga kunkema mwenga. Tunnu'banga paali pa Kilisitu, muawane na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kwa mwanjaa, Kilisitu aabileli na sambi, lakini Nnu'ngu' aampangite abe sambi kwa kitumbu situ, li'nga kwa ndi'la yake tupate panga aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Kwa mwanjaa twenga twapangakasi pamope na Nnu'ngu', tunnu'ba muno kanemuyi'ki'ti ngu'ngu' yamwipoki bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' iobe wabule. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Nnu'ngu' abaya nyinya, <char style="qt">“Pansimu waupwaika naakuyu'wine, naatikuyangatia lisu'ba lya ukosopoli.”</char> Nimmakianga panga “Nsimu waupwaika” nga wu'no. Na nambi'yambi' nga “Lisu'ba lya ukosopoli.”<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Tumpangyali mundu likowe lyolyoti lya kumpanga aku'bale, li'nga utumisi witu wakane bonekana na kipi'li'. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Ila tulaya mumakowe goti panga twenga twaatumisi ba Nnu'ngu'. Tukomeya mungu'su'mbu', tabu na siki mbali'mbali'. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Tuteku'mbu'lwa, twaai muutabilwe no yobelwa pabandu. Twaapangite mengo manonopau, twaagonjikeli lugono, na twaalileli. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Kai' tulaya panga twaatumisi ba Nnu'ngu' kwa upeleteu, utangi, ukomeyi na kwa unogau, kwo longoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu na upendo wa kakape, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />na kwo ala mayi'gano ga kakape. Tupanga ago goti kwa makakala ga Nnu'ngu' na aki nga yombo yitu ya ngondo kwa luboko lwamalyo na kunki'ya. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Twiibi'i wiso kwo isimilwa no salaulilwa, bi'ki'lwa lukoolo no lumbilwa. Tuganiyilwa panga twaabu'su', lakini kumbe tulongela ga kakape, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />tubonekana kati twangatanganikwa, lakini kumbe twaatanganikwa muno. Tubonekana panga twendawaa, kumbe twaakoti! Tuteku'mbu'lwa muno lakini kumbe tubulagilweli. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Kai', tubonekana panga twendausunika lakini kumbe wakati woti twendapulaika. Tubonekana panga twaaki'ba, lakini kumbe twapei utayili bandu baingi. Tubonekana panga ntu'pu' kili'be, lakini kumbe tubile na kila kili'be.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Mwaalongo bitu Akolinto, tulongei na mwenga mpu'la bai kwa mwanjaa tutekumpenda kwa myoyo yitu yoti. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Upendo witu kwinu mwenga unayomokali, ila mwenga ngamwamuibiliye upenda winu kwitu twenga. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Nambi'yambi' nilongela na mwenga kati nilongela na bana panga, mutupende kwa myoyo yinu yoti, kati twenga mwatumpendi mwenga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2CO 6:13">Makwi'li'ko bu'kana na bandu bangali kuntanga Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:13">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Ox plow yoke goad - LB00020" file="OxPlowYokeGoad_LB00020.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="6:13" /> <verse eid="2CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Kanemuyangatiane na bandu bangali u'bi'lya. Buli, aki na ulau yendayu'wangana? Bweya na lubi'ndu' bendakombwa tama pamope? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kubile na masikisano gaku' kati ya Kilisitu na Ibilisi? Au ywau'bi'lya na ywangali u'bi'lya? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Kubile na masikisano gaku' kati ya Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' na inyago? Kwa mwanjaa twenga nga twanyumba ya Nnu'ngu' ywai nkoti. Kati mwabaite Nnu'ngu' mwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">“Kitamo sangu' salu'a panga kasabe, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">no tyanga pamope nabo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">Nalu'a panga na Nnu'ngu' wabe, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">nabembe baapanga bandu bangu'.” </char><verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Kwa nyo Bwana abaya kai',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">“Mubu'ke pakati yabe, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">mwiibi'ke kuutalu nabo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">kanemukunywe kili'be kisapu, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">na nenga naalu'a kumpokyanga. </char><verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />
    <char style="qt">Nenga naapanga na Tati' binu, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">
    <char style="qt">mwenga mwaapanga mwabana bangu', analu'me na alwawa, </char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:18">Abaya Bwana Mwene Makakala Goti.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Bai, mwaapendwa bangu', kwa mwanjaa tupeyilwe malagano ago goti, bai twipeleteye bu'ka mumakowe goti gagawesa sapuya yi'ga na loo yitu, no yendelya tama kwa kwipeleteya na kumwisimu Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pulaa ya Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Tulu'ba muyu'we myoyo yinu kwitu. Tunankosyali mundu ywoywoti, wala kunsulu mundu, wala kumpangya mundu maakau. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Nilongela gano kwenda kwa kumuukumu lili, kwa mwanjaa kati mwanilongei patumbu panga mubile mumyoyo yitu. Tubile pamope na mwenga ata kwo lama au waa pamope. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Nendakwipuna mala yambone kwa kitumbu sinu na kai' nendakwilumba, na munikamwimboko muno na kunipanga nipulaike muno ata manaitei kaniku'su'mbu'lwa muno.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Patwaaikite Makedonia twaapu'mu'li lili kwa mwanjaa, twaabile mungu'su'mbu' kila lwingo. Panja paabile na mataukano, na mumyoyo yitu kwaabile na kyukala. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Lakini Nnu'ngu' ywaakamwamboko bandu babausunika, aatukamwimboko na twenga kwa ndi'la yo isa kwake Tito. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Lakini kwenda isa kwa Tito baili, ila kai' kwa mboko yamunkamwile. Atuawanikiye mwamwanibi'ki kilu'lu', usunika kwinu na kuniaukya nenga. Na panigayu'wine go, naatipulaika muno.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ata manaitei balua yanamwaandikile yampangite muusunike, lakini naaibwenili panga naatiakaya. Kakape panga patumbu naatiyuta kwo tanga panga balua yo yampei usuni, lakini yaai pasene bai. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Lakini nambi'yambi' nendapulaika, kwenda kwa mwanjaa mwaatiusunika lili, ila kwa kitumbu sa usuni yinu yaimpangite mugalambuke bu'ka mumasambi ginu. Mwaatiusunika kwa ndi'la yaabini Nnu'ngu', kwa nyo twenga tunnumiyeli kwa ndi'la yoyoti. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Kwa mwanjaa usuni yaibu'kana na Nnu'ngu' impangiya mundu agalambuke bu'ka musambi no kosopolelwa, na ntu'pu' mayuto, lakini usuni ya dunia yi'no ileta kiwo. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Lolange, usuni yi' ya Nnu'ngu' mwailetike pwaila kasinu, impangite mube na kilu'lu' muno so panga gagapwaika, kumpangite mwiyi'mi panga gamupanga ga kakape. Kai' kumpangite mugasukwe malau, mung'ang'amuke na muyogope, minyikia kunibona no binia muno panga ywakosite apalikwa pwatilwa. Kwa ago goti mulayite panga ntu'pu' likosa mumakowe goti.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Kitumbu kiku'lu' so andika balua yi'lu' yabileli kwa ywakosite au ywakosilwe. Naandike li'nga mwenga mwabene mutange nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' mu'lu' mwamukasana kwipiya kwa kitumbu situ. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Apo nga mwatukamwimboko muno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Kwenda kamulwamboko baili, ila twaatipulaika muno patumweni Tito apulaike kwa kitumbu sa mwenga mwaboti mwaaupulaise mwoyo wake. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Nenga naatikunnumba nnu'ngi' yake, na mwenga muniisiyeli. Na kila kili'be sa twammakiye sai sa kakape, kwa nyo ku'lu' kwilumba kwitu kwa Tito kwa kitumbu sinu kukong'ondelilwe panga kakape. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Na upendo wake kasinu wendayongekeya muno paku'mbu'kya yu'wa kwinu na mwamwampoki kwa isima na kwo lendema. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Nendapulaika muno kwa mwanjaa nendakumwu'bi'lyanga mumakowe goti.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Unogamwoyo wa Kikilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Mwaalongo bitu, tupenda kummakiyanga bu'kana na ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' yabapeyilwe bandu ba makanisa ga ku Makedonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Pamope no panga baabile mumapayilwo makali', uki'ba na tabu yabaaipatike, pulaa yabe yabile ngu'lu' yayaapangite babe anogamwoyo bo piya ili'be yabe. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Nimmakianga panga baapiyite bu'kana na uweso wabe no pi'ti'li'ki'a, kai' kwo penda bene bai. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Kabakokotya kutulu'ba muno panga bapate lipala lyo panga kiyangatani mulyengo lya kwayangatia aumini ba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Baapiyike kwo pi'ti'li'ki'ya kulikoni mwatupi'kanilyage twenga kwa mwanjaa, wi'ti' baaipiyike kwa Bwana, bu'kapo kwitu twenga kati mwapala Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Apo ngapatwannu'bite Tito aise annyangatiange yomolya lyengo lyo, lyo piya, kwa mwanjaa ywembe ngaywaatumbwile kasinu. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Mwenga muyaliwite kila kili'be. Mubile nayo imani, milongelo, ikima, kilu'lu' so panga gagapwaika, na upendo winu kwitu. Bai, mube nyinyonyo na mungu'ngu' yo piya kwa kwayangatia bi'ngi'.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Nimwamulisali mwenga piya, ila nipala niubone upendo winu panga wa kakape kwo landanisa na bi'ngi' bene kilu'lu' so yangatia. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Mutangite panga Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu aampei ngu'ngu' yake. Pamope no panga aabile tayili, lakini aaipangite nki'ba kwa kitumbu sinu, li'nga kwo pi'tya uki'ba wake, mube mwamatayili. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Bu'kana na liwaso lyo piya, nimmakianga lyalimpwaika panga, mwaka waupite mwabile mwaalongoi kwo baa na kilu'lu' so piya na mwaalongoli tumbwa piya mbanje. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Kwa nyo muyomoleli kwa kilu'lu' lyengo linu kati pamwaatumbwile. Mupiye, bu'kana na yamubile nayo. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Kwa mwanjaa, ywapiya si'lu' sabile naso kwa mwoyo wo penda, Nnu'ngu' endapokya. Na kwenda kwa si'lu' sangali baa naso lili. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Mabinio gangu' kwenda mwenga muku'su'mbu'lwe na igombo ya kwayangatia bi'ngi' lili, ila kila kili'be kibe nsawani. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Nsimu wu'no mubile na ili'be yambone, kwa nyo mwayangatiye bababile ntu'pu' li'nga nabembe pabaaba na yambone baanyangatiye pamwalu'a baa ntu'pu'. Kwo panga nyo, mwalu'a baa sawasawa. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Kati mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, <char style="qt">“Ywaakongwa yambone aapi'ti'li'ki'yali, na wala ywaakongwa njene aapu'ngu'ki'lwali.” </char><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tito na aine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ninsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu ampei Tito mwoyo wo penda kunyangatia mwenga, kati mwanibile nawo nenga kasinu. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Nilongela nyo kwa mwanjaa twaatikunnu'ba muno aise kasinu, na ayi'ki'tile. Kai' aisa kwo penda mwene na kwa kilu'lu' muno sa kunnyangatia. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Pamope na ywembe, tunyabuya nnongo witu ywalumbilwa mumakanisa goti kwa lyengo lyo ala Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Kai' makanisa gansawi nnongo ywo alongwane pamope na twenga kwo peleka mapiyo kwa aumini ba ku Yelusalemu. Lyengo lyo lya ngu'ngu', limpanga Bwana akwi'yi'lwe, kai' lilaya mwatubile na mwoyo wa kwayangatia bi'ngi'.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Tukani bi'ki'lwa lukoolo na mundu ywoywoti bu'kana na uyi'mi'li'ki witu wo peleka ili'be yabaipiyike bandu kwa unogamwoyo wabe. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Mabinio gitu kwenda panga manogau nnu'ngi' ya Bwana bai lili, ila na kwa bandu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Pamope na bo, tuntuma nnongo ywi'ngi' abe na ki Tito. Nnongo ywo ailayite kasitu kwa ndi'la mbali'mbali' panga ai na kilu'lu' muno so panga kasi, na nambi'yambi' ai na kilu'lu' muno kulikoni patumbu kwa mwanjaa endakumwu'bi'lyanga muno. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Tito, ywembe mumini nnyangu', na apanga kasi pamope na nenga ya kunyangatia mwenga. Abo alongo abi'li' bembe atumilwa bu'ka mumakanisa gi'ngi' na bembe bankwi'ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Kwa nyo, mwalaye bandu bo upendo winu li'nga makanisa gatange panga tubile na kitumbu sa kwilumbiya bu'kana na mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Uyangatiyi kwa Akilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Nimmakianga panga, ntu'pu' kitumbu sa kumwandikyanga bu'kana na kwayangatia kwinu aumini ba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Nitangite panga mupala yangatia. Naatikwilumba muno bu'kana na mwenga kwa bandu ba Makedonia. Naabakiye panga mwabandu ba Akaya mwaaibi'kite wiso piya bu'ka makaso. Na kilu'lu' sinu so piya saapangite bandu baingi pano bapende piya. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Naatuma alongo bo li'nga kwilumbiya kwitu bu'kana no piya kwinu kanekube mayi'gi'yo ga bule, ila mulaye panga kakape mwaibi'i wiso piya kati mwanaabakiye bandu ba Makedonia. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Manaitei naisa kwo na bandu ba Makedonia na kummona panga munaibi'kali wiso, apo mwalu'a tuisiya bu'kana na liu'bi'lyo litu kasinu. Kai' ata mwenga mwaaisika. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Kwa nyo niibweni panga yendapwaika alongo bangu' ba, balongoli isa kasinu li'nga babi'ke wiso ili'be yamwaalagi piya. Kwa nyo mwaapanga mupiyike kwo penda mwabene, kwenda kwo amuliswali.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Muku'mbu'ki panga ywapanda kisene aauna kisene, na ywapanda kiku'lu', aauna kiku'lu'. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Kila mundu apiye kwo bu'kana na mwaupendi mwoyo wake, kaneapiye kwo usunika wala kwo amuliswa, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ampenda ywapiya kwa mwoyo wa pulaa. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Na Nnu'ngu' endakombwa kunnyalya pi'ta mwamupala, li'nga wakati woti mube na kila samupala, na mupange manogau gambone ga kwayangatia bi'ngi'. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Aapiyike yambone kwa mwoyo wo penda, aapei aki'ba, aki yake yendakonda milele.” </char><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Nnu'ngu' ngaywampeya mpandi mbeyu na kilyo. Nyinyonyo aalu'a kumpeya mwenga mbeyu na kwiyongekeya, na kunnyongekeya mauno ga aki yinu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Ywembe aalu'a kumpeya utayili mugoti li'nga, kila lisu'ba mube mwaanogamwoyo. Apo bandu nga pabaalu'a kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa ili'be yatwaalu'a kwapelekya bu'ka kasinu. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Kwa mwanjaa, lyengo li' lya unogamwoyo lyamulipanga lyayangatia aumini babapu'ngu'kilwe bai lili, ila lyapanga bandu baingi bansukulu muno Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Baalu'a kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa kasi yinu ilaya panga mwenga mwaatumisi annogau. Kai' bankwi'ya kwa kitumbu sa kwiyu'wa kwinu Abali Inannoga bu'kana na Yesu Kilisitu, na mwamubile na unogamwoyo wa kwayangatia bembe na bi'ngi' boti. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Nabembe bannu'bya kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa upendo nku'lu', kwa kitumbu sa ngu'ngu' ngu'lu' ya Nnu'ngu' yamupeyilwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tunsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa upo yangalikombwa kwiawanikia.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Pauli aikengya bu'kana na lyengo lyake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Nenga na Pauli namwene nendakunnu'banga muno, kwa pangali kibuli na kwo utu'li wake Kilisitu, nenga nanibayilwa panga nendayogopa panibaa pamope na mwenga, lakini panibaa kuutalu na mwenga nankali'. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ninnu'banga panga, panaaisa kasinu, kanemwanipange nibe nankali'. Nibaya nya kwa mwanjaa nitangite panga nawesa baa nankali' kwa bandu boti babagania panga twenga tutama kati twabandu ba padunia yi'no. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Pamope no panga tutama mudunia yi'no, lakini tuku'mbwanali ngondo kati mwabaku'mbwana bandu ba padunia yi'no. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Kwa mwanjaa yombo yatutumya mungondo yitu, kati yabatumya bandu ba padunia lili, ila ibile na makakala gagabu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' gagawesa bomwana lubi'go lwa andumu na maganio goti ga ubu'su', <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />no bomwana iku'balo yoti yabaipunia bandu kwo taukya ilimu ya Nnu'ngu'. Kai' tugaboywa na kugataba mawaso gabe goti, li'nga gawese kunnyu'wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Twenga tuyi'mi wiso kumpwatya kila mundu ywangali yu'wa, lakini tupala wi'ti' mwenga mube mwaatimilika kwo yu'wa kati mwaipalikwa.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mwenga mulingulya makowe kwa panja bai. Mundu ywoywoti ywaibona panga ywembe nga ywa Kilisitu, aku'mbu'ki panga na twenga kai' twabandu ba Kilisitu kati ywembe mwabile ywa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Pi'ngi' nibonekana panga nendakwilumba muno bu'kana na utawala watupei Bwana. Lakini ata nyo niibonali oni kwa mwanjaa utawala wo, woalabiya lili, ila wokangamaya imani yinu. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Nikana bonekana panga mubalua yangu' nendakunnyogoya. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Nibaya nyo kwa mwanjaa bi'ngi' babaya panga, “Balua ya Pauli ibile na milongelo minonopau na mikali'. Lakini pabaa papipi na twenga apanga ntu'pu' makakala, kai' milongelo yake ipanga kati ntu'pu' maana.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Bandu kati bo batange panga, galu' gatubaya mubalua patubaa kuutalu na mwenga, nga nyinyonyo mwatupanga ata mana twabaa pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Twenga tulowali kwibi'ka au kwilandaniya na balu' bandu babailumba bene. Bandu babaipanga bembe panga nga kili'ngo sa kwili'ngya, na bandu babailandanisa bene na bene, abo balaya panga alogeloge. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Lakini twenga twaailumbali pi'ta kili'ngo sa lyengo lyatupeyilwe. Ila, twalu'a kwilumba bu'kana na mipaka yatuikiye mulyengo lyaatupei Nnu'ngu' bai, na mipaka yi' ngaimwikya ata mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Manaitei twenga tunaikali kasinu, ntu'pu' kitumbu sa kwilumba, lakini tuwesa kwilumba kwa mwanjaa twaai twalongoi isa kunnetya Abali Inannoga yaibu'kana na Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Wala kwilumba kwitu kwa kitumbu sa lyengo lyabapangite bandu bi'ngi' lili, ila tuu'bi'lya panga imani yinu mwaiyendelya ku'la, lyengo litu pakati yinu ngapalyayendelya ku'la. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Apo ngapatwawesa ala Abali Inannoga mumili'ma ya kuutalu pi'ta mili'ma yinu, kwa mwanjaa tukana kwilumba bu'kana na lyengo lyaliyomwike pangilwa pandu pa mundu ywi'ngi'.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Lakini kati mwagabaya Maandiko mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Mundu ywoywoti ywailumba, na ailumbe bu'kana na lyengo lya Bwana.”</char> <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Mundu ywayi'ki'ti'lwa, kwenda yu'lu' ywailumba mwene lili, ila yu'lu' ywalumbilwa na Bwana.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Pauli na atumilwe ba ubu'su'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ata ikatei nilongela kati nannogeloge pasene, nilu'ba munikomeye. Eloo, munikomeye pasene. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Nimmi'kya bwigu, lakini bwigu waubu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa mwenga mubile kati nnwawa mwi'nja ywanankobeki nnalu'me yumo, li'nga ninnete kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Lakini nambi'yambi' niyogopa panga kati mwaakongilwe Awa na yu'lu' nng'ambo nng'anga, namwenga mwaakongelwa no kotoka kumpenda Kilisitu kwo nogeya na upeleteu. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Nibaya nya, kwa mwanjaa mwenga muyu'ngu'ya kumpokya mundu ywaisa ala makowe gagapi'yana na galu' ga Yesu mwatwaalike twenga. Kai' mupokya loo ywi'ngi' au mayi'gano gi'ngi' kwa kiyu'ngu'ya, pamope no panga galandanali na galu' gamwaapokile bu'ka kwitu.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Nenga niibonali panga nansene pi'ta abo babaipanga kati “atumilwe aku'lu'.” <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Iwesa panga nenga niwesali longela wisowiso, lakini kwa ilimu, nibile wiso. Na likowe li' tulilayite mpu'la kwinu kwa masu'ba goti na kwa ndi'la yoti.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Buli, naapangite sambi kwiuluya namwene li'nga kuntu'ndu'bi'ya mwenga, kwa kumwalya Injili ya Nnu'ngu' pangali li'pi'lwa? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Panaabile kanintumikia mwenga, naabile kanipokya liposo bu'ka mumakanisa gi'ngi', na yaai kati naapokonywa mali yabe li'nga nintumikiye mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Panaabile na mwenga no pu'ngu'ki'lwa, naabileli na kigombo kwa mundu ywoywoti. Kwa mwanjaa alongo bu'ka Makedonia baanileti kila sanipalage, na naatikwili'ndi'la muno li'nga naakane baa na kigombo kwinu, na nilu'a yendelya panga nyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Kati mwaibile kweli ya Kilisitu nkati yangu', ntu'pu' mundu ywoywoti munkoa wa Akaya ywawesa kunikanikia kwilumba bu'kana na alyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Mwanjaa namani nibaya ngani kumpeya kigombo? Buli, mugania nimpendili? Lili! Nnu'ngu' atangite panga nendakumpenda!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Nilu'a yendelya panga kasi kati mu'lu' mwanipanga nambi'yambi', li'nga atumilwe bo babaipanga kati bembe nga aku'lu' kanebapate lipala lya kwilumba panga bapanga kasi kati twenga. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Bandu kati bo nga atumilwe ba ubu'su', bapanga kasi ya kwakonga bandu, na kwipanga kati atumilwe ba Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Wala likowe lyo sangalali, kwa mwanjaa ata Ibilisi mwene aipanga kati malaika wa bweya. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Kwa nyo alyo likowe lyo sangalali, manaitei abo atumisi bake kabaipanga kati atumisi ba aki, kuundi'la baalu'a pata si'lu' sabapalikwa pata bu'kana na iyendo yabe.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngu'su'mbu' ya Pauli kati ntumilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Kai' nibaya nnyinya, mundu ywoywoti kaneaganiye panga nenga nannogeloge. Lakini ata mana kamugania nyo, bai munipoki kati na nnogeloge li'nga nipate kwilumba pasene. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Milongelo ya kwilumba yaniilongela nambi'yambi', ibu'kali kwa Bwana, ila nilongela kati nannogeloge. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Kwa mwanjaa baingi bendakwilumba kati bandu ba dunia mwabapanga, na nenga nilu'a kwilumba. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Mwenga mwabene ikima, ngamuwesa kwakomeya ata alogeloge. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Munkomeya ata mundu ywaapanga abanda, mundu ywannyibya na kumpokonywa mali yinu, ywansalawa na kunku'mbwa kuminyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Niibona oni panga, twaabile “twa akigopi muno” kugapanga makowe kati go kasinu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Lakini mana kubile na mundu ywaalowa kwilumba, na nenga naalowa kwilumba kwa likowe lyo. (Nilongela nya kati nannogeloge.) <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Manaitei bembe Aebrania au Baisilaili au bembe ba lukolo lwa Bulaimu, bai na nenga nyinyonyo kai'. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Nambi'yambi' nilu'a longela kati niminya lilalu', buli bembe atumisi ba Kilisitu? Ata nenga nantumisi wa Kilisitu pi'ta bembe. Nenga nipangite kasi inannonopa muno, nitami muutabilwe kwa mala yambone muno, na kwa mala yambone niteku'mbu'lwa, kai' naabile mmaule go waa kwa mala yambone. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Nimesilwe mikwasu salasini na tisa na Ayahudi kwa kila panimeselwa, mpaka mala tano. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Nimesilwe mikwasu kwa mala itatu, naai papipi no waa kwo ku'mbu'lwa maliwe mala yimo. Ngalaba yaanialabiki mala itatu, na amo naakelike mubaali kilo na muntwekati yake. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Kwa mala yambone mumyanja yangu' nikwembine na tabu ya nkukulo mumabi'ndi', nikwembine na tabu ya apokonyoli, tabu yaibu'ka kwa Ayahudi ayangu' na yaibu'ka kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi. Naapatike tabu panaabile pakilambo, mmwitu na mubaali, naabile mmaule bu'kana na babaipanga aumini aitu na kumbe lili. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Nipangite kasi inanonopa no totoyelwa, kwa mala yambone nitekeleka, nitangite tama na njala na kwibona nnyota, kwa mala yambone nitami na njala kwo kosa kilyo no tama mumbepo pangali ngu'bo. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Pamope na go goti, kila lisu'ba nibile na kigombo sa kasi yangu' kwa makanisa goti. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Manaitei mundu ywi'ngi' kigopi, nanenga niibona nakigopi. Nyinyonyo, mundu ywoywoti payingiyilwa musambi, mwoyo wangu' wendalumya muno.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Mana kanipalikwa kwilumba, nilu'a kwilumba bu'kana na ukigopi wangu'. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Nnu'ngu', Tati' ba Bwana Yesu, ywapalikwa lumbilwa milele, atangite panga nilongelali ubu'su'. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Panaabile Damasko ntawala ywaabile pai' ya nkulungwa Areta, aabile kaaniyu'bi'lya pakilambo sa Damasko li'nga aniboywe. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Lakini naauluyilwe mukitu'ndu' kiku'lu' kwo pi'tya mulilisa lya mukingu'mbi', nganiku'su'pu'ka bu'ka mumaboko gake. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul lowered in basket - LB00333" file="PaulLoweredInBasket_Acts9.25_LB00333.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="11:33" /><verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Makowe gayambi' na maumukwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Nipalikwa kwilumba, pamope no panga inipwaikali kili'be. Lakini nambi'yambi' nilu'a baya bu'kana na makowe gaayambi' na maumukulwa ganipatike bu'ka kwa Bwana. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Nintangite mundu yumo ywalu'mbine na Kilisitu, ywembe myaka ku'mi nansese yaipite, aatu'ndu'bi'yilwe mpaka kunani munomuno. (Akwo nitangiteli panga aai kwa yi'ga au kwa loo, Nnu'ngu' ngaywatangite.) <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Nibwi'li'gi'ya baya, nitangiteli panga mundu ywo ywatu'ndu'bi'yilwe, aatu'ndu'bi'yilwe abile kwa yi'ga au aabile kwa loo, Nnu'ngu' ngaywatangite, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />aatu'ndu'bi'yilwe mpaka kumbepo. Akwo ngayu'wa makowe gagaiyilwe muno, makowe go ata mundu ayi'ki'ti'lwali kugaawanikia. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Bai nilu'a kwilumba bu'kana na mundu kati ywo, lakini bu'kana na nenga namwene niilumbali, ila nilu'a kwilumba kwa ukigopi wangu'. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Mana nikapala kwilumba, nilu'e pangali nannogeloge, kwa mwanjaa nilu'e baya ukakape sika. Lakini niilumbali li'nga mundu ywoywoti aakane kunibona na ywa ngama muno kulikoni mwabanibona no yu'wa bu'ka kasangu'.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Lakini naapeyilwe ngu'su'mbu' muyi'ga yangu' yaibile kati mimwa waunikima. Likowe lyo lyaai lya kindumindumi ywatumilwe na Ibilisi anipei ngu'su'mbu' li'nga makowe maku'lu' ganiumukulilwe kaneganipange nilobi kwipuna muno. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Nannu'bite muno Bwana mala itatu bu'kana na likowe lya kunibu'ki'ya mimwa wo. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Lakini Bwana nganibakia, “Ngu'ngu' yangu' yendakuli'ngana, kwa mwanjaa, uweso wangu' utimilika na ukigopi wako.” Kwa nyo nilu'a kwilumba kwo napusika muno bu'kana na ukigopi wangu' li'nga uweso wa Kilisitu utame panani yangu'. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Kwa nyo, niyi'ki'tyana na ukigopi, tukanilwa, ngu'su'mbu', siki na tabu kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu, kwa mwanjaa panibaa na kigopi, ngapanibaa na makakala.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyenyo sa Pauli kwa Akolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Nibile kati nannogeloge, lakini mwenga ngamunili'ndi'ndi'li nibe nyo. Kwa mwanjaa naapalikwe nilumbilwe na mwenga, pamope no panga nibonekana nipwaikali, na nenga nanseneli pi'ta bababile “atumilwe aku'lu'.” <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Panaabile kwinu naapangite kati nantumilwe, kwa mwanjaa naapangite myasu, maayabu na mangelongelo kwo komeya goti. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ntu'pu' likowe lyolyoti lyanalipangite kwa makanisa gi'ngi' lyanikotwike panga kwinu, ila kwo kotoka baa na kigombo sinu. Munisami bai! <verse eid="2CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Nambi'yambi' niibi'ka wiso isa kasinu kwa mala yene tatu, na wala naapangali na kigombo sinu. Nipalali mali yinu, ila nimpalanga mwenga mwabene. Kwa mwanjaa lyengo lya bana lili kwaabi'kya amana abelei babe, ila ipalikwa abelei kwa bana babe. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Kwa nyo nipulaika ata tumya kila kili'be sanibile naso kwa kitumbu sinu mwenga, ata kwipiya namwene. Lakini ibonekana panga mwaniyendelya kumpenda muno, ngapamuyendelya pu'ngu'ya upendo winu kwangu'.<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Muyi'ki'tile panga naai nakigomboli kasinu. Lakini bandu bi'ngi' balu'a baya panga, “Kwa mwanjaa Pauli nng'anga aasopite bandu kwa kwakonga.” <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Buli, naampokonywi kili'be sosoti pi'tya kwa bandu banaatumike kasinu? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Nannu'bite Tito aise kasinu pamope na nnongo witu ywi'ngi'. Buli, muwesa baya Tito aatekunnyibya? Bai, nenga pamope na ywembe twaai twabamo mulyengo, kai' ata nnyendo witu gumo?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Kwaali' mugania mpaka nambi'yambi', twiikengya twabene nnu'ngi' yinu! Lakini tulongei makowe ga nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', ku'no tulu'mbine na Kilisitu. Na sosoti satupanga, mwaalongo bangu' mwamupendilwe, tupanga li'nga kunnyangatia mwenga mukangamale muimani. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Nipanga nya kwa mwanjaa niyogopa panga panaaisa, mwabaali kati mu'lu' mwanipendi mube. Niyogopa pi'ngi' kuwesa baa na nnomo, bwigu, nyongo, kwipendelea, ubai, mayu'yu'to, kwipuna na puyo nkati yinu. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Niyogopa panga panaaisa kai' kasinu, Nnu'ngu' wangu' awesa nipanga niibone oni nnu'ngi' yinu. Naatiku'ku'li'ka muno bu'kana na bandu baingi nkati yinu babapangite sambi ya upege, usapu na makowe gi'ngi' ga oni, lakini banabuyanganiali kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa galu' gabagapangite.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Makwi'li'ko ga kuundi'la na salamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Wu'no mwanja wangu' wene tatu isa kasinu. Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya panga, <char style="qt">“Kila likowe lyalibu'kana na mwalo lipalikwa likong'ondelwe kwa akong'ondeli abi'li' au atatu.”</char> <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Niyomwike kunkwi'li'ka panaabile pamope na mwenga mumwanja wangu' wu'lu' wene ibi'li'. Nambi'yambi' nibwi'li'gi'ya kai' kunkwi'li'ka nibile kuutalu panga, panaaisa kai' naalu'a kwabi'kyali kiya balu' babaapangite sambi palipite, wala bi'ngi' boti. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Mupala ukong'ondeli panga Kilisitu kakape alongela pi'tya nenga. Kilisitu ywembe kigopi lili kasinu, ila ywembe alaya uweso wake kwinu mwenga. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Pamope no panga aabambilwe bu'kana na ukigopi, lakini nambi'yambi' alama kwa uweso wa Nnu'ngu'. Nyinyonyo na twenga twaakigopi kati ywembe, lakini kwa kitumbu sinu tulama pamope na ywembe kwa makakala ga Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mwipekeseni mwabene mupate tanga panga kakape mubile nayo imani. Mwilinguli mwabene! Buli, mutangiteli panga Kilisitu Yesu abile nkati yinu? Na mana lili bai, mwenga musindilwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Lakini niu'bi'lya panga mulu'a tanga panga twenga tunasindwali. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Tunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' panga kanemupange likowe lyolyoti lilau, kwenda twenga tupala tubonekane panga tutesinda lili. Ila tupala mupange manogau ata mana twenga katubonekana panga tusindilwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Kwa mwanjaa tuwesali panga lyolyoti lyalitaukana na ukakape, ila tuwesa panga ukakape bai. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Twendanapusika, kwa mwanjaa twenga kila patubaa twaakigopi, mwenga mubaa na makakala. Tunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' amwawane. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Bai, niandika balua yi'no nibile kuutalu na mwenga, li'nga panaalu'a ika kasinu kanenaabe nankali' kwo tumya utawala wangu' wanipeyilwe na Bwana, wo senga na wala wo bomwanali. <verse eid="2CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Nambi'yambi' mwaalongo bangu', nendakunnaganga. Mube mwaatimya muimani, mukamwanemboko, mube na umope, mutame kwa amani. Na ywembe Nnu'ngu' ywa upendo na amani aalu'a baa pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Musalimiyane kwa upendo wa Kilisitu. Ku'no, apeleteu boti ba Nnu'ngu' bendakunsalimiyanga.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Ngu'ngu' ya Bwana Yesu Kilisitu na upendo wa Nnu'ngu' na umope wa Loo Mpeleteu ube pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>